OL,3,GNEWSAStudent admits murdering woman in
OL,4,A'Dexter' kill room
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Fthat readers may find distressing
OL,9,FA forensic science student obsessed
OL,10,Fwith the US television drama Dexter has
OL,11,Fadmitted murdering a 24-year-old woman
OL,12,Fafter luring her to a plastic-lined
OL,13,F"kill room" inside an Airbnb.
OL,15,FBenjamin William Day, 20, changed his
OL,16,Fplea to guilty on the second day of his
OL,17,Ftrial at Wolverhampton Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
